Z||000005||Jaygee79||12-21-2001||11:19 AM||||I've been to so many places, most when I was too young to remember.  I've been to Niagara Falls, Minnesota, Oklahoma, Ohio, Virginia, Maine, New Hampshire, Pennsylvania, etc.  but I think my favorite place to go is Martha's Vineyard  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
