Z||000012||MinnGreenGT||12-21-2001||12:19 PM||||<FONT COLOR="green"><B>Scotland</B></FONT><BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/eileandonan.jpg">    <BR><FONT SIZE="1">took this photo last year during my honeymoon...</FONT><P>Been there 3 times now- and I absolutely love it there! Especially the Highlands and The Isle of Skye.  Someday I'd like to move over there... at least for awhile (I'd have to take my Fiero with and go cruising with PK- guess I'd have to put a muffler on it too).<P>And I can't wait to go back!<P>[edit] Oh yeah... I've also been to Hawaii (twice), Germany, Hong Kong, China, Mexico, Alaska, and a good portion of the US. Sadly our Australian vacation was cancelled due to a grandfather's illness. Did I mention that both my parents are employees of NWA?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">[/edit]<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by MinnGreenGT (edited 12-21-2001).]||||reg||1
