Z||000016||Patrick's Dad||12-21-2001||12:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>Negril, Jamaica **** (Honeymoon    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  )<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Orief; how long ago? My wife and I honeymooned there eight years ago 9/12 (yes, we were married on 9/11).<P>Otherwise, on the edge of the "My Sacrifice" video set. If you're watching the video, in the scenes inside the bus, look outside, and you'll see fog billowing. My wife and I are behind the fog.<P>My wife went to East Berlin while the wall was still up. ||||reg||1
Z||000017||Little Duce Coupe||12-21-2001||12:48 PM||||Mine's a little on the dull side but....<P> A place called Minaki in Ontario Canada.<P>Spent a week n a half fishing there when I was younger.  <P>Never seen a sky sooo big, or heard a quiet sooo quiet.<P>Year round population back then was prob. about 55 people. Had a store/Post office/ gas station and a lodge.<BR>We camped in the wilderness about 45 min away, great place Canada..just haven't figured how to move their yet.<P>Oh....and Scotland is the #1 place on the list of....future vacation desires.<P>------------------<BR>Little Duce Coupe<BR>"You Don't Know What She Costs"<P>[This message has been edited by Little Duce Coupe (edited 12-21-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Little Duce Coupe (edited 12-21-2001).]||||reg||10
