Z||000019||JSocha||12-21-2001||12:57 PM||||I myself would love to go to JAPAN. And maybe even China.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Was in the Carribean on our honeymoon cruise three years back.  But IMO,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_brow.gif"> the Jamican stop, or actually the tour sucked, even though the sites were amazingly beautiful!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"> Dang pickpocket wannabees ruined an otherwise pleasurable experience!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">||||reg||9
