Z||000024||Ken Wittlief||12-21-2001||02:54 PM||||Observation deck of the south WTC tower this spring - and the ferry ride to the statue of liberty was great.<P>if you live in the US definately goto wash DC and see the stuff there - you are already paying for it with your taxes - the Wall is more than you expect it to be, the AeroSpace Musium at the Smithstonian is awesome - just taking a day and walking around the 'mall' in DC is something american should do at some point - this may sound silly but its even better if you can do it alone.<P>I agree with Kennedy space center in florida<P> the rocky mountains in colorado <P> and if you are into sail, surfing or ocean swimming you cant beat the Outer Banks in North Carolina - you can stay at the camp ground for practically nothing and be a beach bum for a week.||||reg||10
