Z||000037||stimpy||12-21-2001||10:30 PM||||I've been fortunate to have visited some very neat places in my life. I lived near Brussels, Belgium when I was in high school, and the Grand Place definately rates as one of the neatest places in the world for all kinds of things, people watching, eating, drinking (*hic*), and just feeling the history. <BR>Also visited many places in The Netherlands, Germany (visited West Berlin when there still was a West Berlin), Austria, Italy, Switzerland, Spain, and the United Kingdom.<BR>Hell, I've even been to Canada! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> (Vancouver. What a neat city that is!)<BR>Also went to Cozumel, Mexico on our honeymoon. Very relaxing there.<P>||||reg||1
